"text": "There's the education bill.",
"conf": -0.44,
"no_speech": 0.56
},
{
"start": 80.0,
"end": 82.0,
"text": "Oh, thank you.",
"conf": -0.44,
"no_speech": 0.56
},
{
"start": 82.0,
"end": 84.0,
"text": "Oh, thank you.",
"conf": -0.44,
"no_speech": 0.56
},
{
"start": 84.0,
"end": 86.0,
"text": "Oh, thank you.",
"conf": -0.44,
"no_speech": 0.56
},
{
"start": 86.0,
"end": 113.6,
"text": "I hope it's good.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.72
},
{
"start": 113.6,
"end": 114.9,
"text": "Let's put it that way.",
"conf": -0.53,
"no_speech": 0.72
},
{
"start": 114.9,
"end": 118.0,
"text": "You know, we're always, we're always, we're done.",
"conf": -0.45,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 120.0,
"end": 122.6,
"text": "You'll find out half a century later.",
"conf": -0.45,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 123.4,
"end": 127.6,
"text": "But, you know, there have been four such pieces of legislation in the history of Congress.",
"conf": -0.45,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 127.6,
"end": 136.5,
"text": "There's the 1787 Morrell Act, the National Defense Education Act.",
"conf": -0.45,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 137.2,
"end": 139.5,
"text": "So, you know, I mean, it's really marked this good.",
"conf": -0.45,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 144.9,
"end": 174.8,
"text": "Thanks for watching!",
"conf": -0.48,
"no_speech": 0.85
}
